    "reasoning": "Four panels distinguish secreted support made by a cell, activation-induced release with possible spread, surface-held cytokine, and a receptor-response variant. The induced panel has actual receptor/target contact, then released material; it does not imply cytokine effects remain local. Variant is explicitly unequal to deletion, and the takeaway denies universal armor. These physical locations answer where support is made, held and can act. The schematic neither isolates a cytokine contribution to a combined clinical product nor supplies improved healthy-tissue safety.",
